{"unit_id":"Sostay__dsh-wallpaper#card-zh","repo":"Sostay/dsh-wallpaper","commit":"e27dff14a1110cc8912a67a24ce04ec054ffb4cc","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wallpaper-plugin 是一款面向 DSH Web 客户端的界面插件，可为应用窗口设置自定义背景并叠加磨砂面板。它在通用设置中加入壁纸控制面板，提供渐变与摄影预设、图片网址和本地图片三种来源，并可调整壁纸透明度、遮罩浓度、模糊程度、适用范围和图片适配方式。配置保存在浏览器本地，适合希望个性化 DSH 外观并保持聊天内容清晰的用户。内置摄影预设通过 picsum.photos 加载；无需 API 密钥或账户。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:7-76","client.js:80-92","client.js:436-455","client.js:1201-1206"]}
{"unit_id":"Sostay__dsh-wallpaper#card-en","repo":"Sostay/dsh-wallpaper","commit":"e27dff14a1110cc8912a67a24ce04ec054ffb4cc","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-wallpaper-plugin customizes DSH Web backgrounds with presets, image URLs, or local uploads. Adjust opacity, blur, frosted masks, and display scope in General Settings. Preferences stay in browser storage. Photo presets use picsum.photos; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:7-76","client.js:80-92","client.js:436-455","client.js:1201-1206"]}
