{"unit_id":"Sostay__dsh-wallpaper#feature-1","repo":"Sostay/dsh-wallpaper","commit":"e27dff14a1110cc8912a67a24ce04ec054ffb4cc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wallpaper-plugin 的功能「背景来源」：可从渐变或摄影预设、图片网址和本地上传中选择壁纸。在通用设置打开壁纸面板后切换来源，选项会即时应用到 DSH 背景。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:7-76","client.js:784-820","client.js:888-991"]}
{"unit_id":"Sostay__dsh-wallpaper#feature-2","repo":"Sostay/dsh-wallpaper","commit":"e27dff14a1110cc8912a67a24ce04ec054ffb4cc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wallpaper-plugin 的功能「磨砂外观调节」：通过滑块修改壁纸透明度、背景遮罩浓度和模糊半径，并选择作用于整窗或仅对话区，改变背景与面板的显示效果。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1008-1079","client.js:436-455"]}
{"unit_id":"Sostay__dsh-wallpaper#feature-3","repo":"Sostay/dsh-wallpaper","commit":"e27dff14a1110cc8912a67a24ce04ec054ffb4cc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wallpaper-plugin 的功能「本地图片壁纸」：选择不超过 20 MB 的图片后，前端会按最大边 2560 像素缩放并转成 JPEG Data URL，保存到浏览器本地供背景显示。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:522-553","client.js:579-591","client.js:940-991"]}
{"unit_id":"Sostay__dsh-wallpaper#feature-4","repo":"Sostay/dsh-wallpaper","commit":"e27dff14a1110cc8912a67a24ce04ec054ffb4cc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wallpaper-plugin 的功能「图片显示方式」：可设置壁纸 cover、contain 或 repeat，让背景按填满、完整呈现或平铺的方式显示，并在设置面板预览效果。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:87-92","client.js:436-455","client.js:706-743"]}
{"unit_id":"Sostay__dsh-wallpaper#caveat-1","repo":"Sostay/dsh-wallpaper","commit":"e27dff14a1110cc8912a67a24ce04ec054ffb4cc","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"使用摄影预设会从 picsum.photos 加载背景图和缩略图；自定义网址图片也由浏览器直接显示，网络图片需可访问。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:43-76","client.js:154-172"]}
{"unit_id":"Sostay__dsh-wallpaper#caveat-2","repo":"Sostay/dsh-wallpaper","commit":"e27dff14a1110cc8912a67a24ce04ec054ffb4cc","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"设置项和本地上传图片以 Data URL 形式存入浏览器 localStorage；存储空间不足时保存可能失败，插件会提示较大的图片改用链接或缩小尺寸。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:80-92","client.js:108-117","client.js:522-553"]}
